I agree that Unity is a likely candidate, but I keep coming back the idea that CON is a gestalt of multiple people. &#39;Concordant Harmony Entity&#39; implies (to me at least) multiple beings merged into one entity that are acting in snyc (or concordance). My bet is that Unity is one of them based on the way that CON talks to Jim in his bio. I also think that Argent Adept, or at least another Virtuoso of the Void, is part of the gestalt as well based on &#39;harmony&#39; being part of CON&#39;s full name. I think there are two more beings part of the gestalt based on nothing more than CON refers to itself as &#39;version 4&#39; but have no idea whom they might be. That last specualation admittingly feels like a stab in the dark, but I&#39;m pretty convinced about the other two guesses.
